  "id": "urdbcwa",
  "title": "Chapter 17:Plant Biology",
  "order": 17,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "4f569ki",
      "content": "Plant biology is the branch of biology that studies plants, their structure, growth, reproduction, metabolism, development, diseases and evolution. Plants are autotrophic organisms capable of producing their own food through photosynthesis."
    },
